"published_at":"2026-10-21T06:40:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027728","verified_at":"2026-10-21T10:05:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5136890-1846018067942588","game_id":"steam-5136890","kind":"announcement","title":"The Cat Room is open: cats, Halloween costumes and controller support","summary":"The Cat Room is open The daycare is taking cats. Unlock the Cat Room from the EXPAND page and it opens straight away, with a stack of cat cages and your first resident: Mochi, a very sociable two-year-old who is good with everyone. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46279203/c3f232f516807cb5007c839ff8d445fd48846c62.gif Cat cages stack two high, each with its own litter tray and bowls. Paying cats arrive in their owner's carrier, and they go home in that same carrier at checkout. Mix them up at your peril. Every","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T00:59:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942588","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5136890-1844751498228392","game_id":"steam-5136890","kind":"announcement","title":"Hello from Kennel Chaos! Our demo is coming to Steam Next Fest","summary":"Hi everyone, and thanks for following Kennel Chaos! This is our very first post, so here's a quick hello, a look at the game, and a date for your calendar. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46279203/eab93976e0b169618a43dc4fdf70080fe51816e7.png What is Kennel Chaos? Kennel Chaos: Daycare Simulator is a first-person co-op game where you and up to seven friends run a dog daycare. Not from a management menu: you ARE the staff. You check the dogs in, follow their care cards, feed them, wash them, walk them and scoo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T02:01:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498228392","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5136890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:19Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5136890":"2026-10-26T08:45:19Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5136890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:19Z"},"5323270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:19Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5136890","app_id":5136890,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:35Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"aba76d18a3c858d44e607aa2c23959810e92ee71c8dc8c9fc7d95c56680644f7","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"친구들과 함께 강아지 유치원을 운영합니다. 잘 안 됩니다. 밥 주고, 씻기고, 산책시키고, 남긴 것도 치우세요. 누군가 문을 열어둬서 강아지 열한 마리가 현관을 발견하기 전에. 아주 착한 강아지들과 함께하는 협동 대혼란.","publishers":[{"name":"Watashi Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Watashi Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1814338800,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Kennel Chaos - Gameplay Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791577436","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"5136890/1872826732/1c62bbcef6e8914921fc23bd0e121936b8c2f8b6/1791102356/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"51368